[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0010","text":"嗯～！这个点心超好吃的～\n雾子也来吃啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0020","text":"呵呵……\n谢谢你……恋钟酱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0030","text":"咦？\n你们俩，还在啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0040","text":"……摩美美酱……\n辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0050","text":"下一个行程还早着呢\n就慢慢待着吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0060","text":"……是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0070","text":"摩美美～？怎么了？\n总觉得跟平时不太一样哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0080","text":"怎么说呢……就是……\n……嗯，还是跟你们俩说吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0090","text":"？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0100","text":"……嗯，还是跟你们俩说吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0110","text":"──咲耶她说了\n关于解散的可能性"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0120","text":"……咲耶，说了那种话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0130","text":"……咲耶桑……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0140","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0150","text":"……！\n……有了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0160","text":"……海边的那个工作……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0170","text":"咲耶和结华在一起！\n我们俩等当天的行程结束后也去汇合！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0180","text":"嗯～／……好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0190","text":"制作人那边我来联系！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02020000_05_0200","text":"一个人的烦恼，就是大家的烦恼！\n一定要解决才行！"}]
